  "title": {
   "en": "A Witch's Love"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "Rin to Hanasaku Majo No Koi"
   },
   {
    "ja": "凛と花朔く魔女の恋"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Flower Blooms With Dignity: A Witch’s Love"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Suddenly, a person's face turns black, and they die a few days later.  Futaba Rinka, who has this special ability, begins living with her cousin Nishimiya Saku after the death of her parents.  Since she was a child, Saku has been Rinka's only source of comfort. And her first love. But Saku has a secret that he hasn't told Rinka...? A love suspense story about a girl with special abilities and a mysterious young man!",
   "ja": "突然人の顔が黒く染まり、するとその人は数日後に死ぬ——。そんな特殊な能力をを持つ二葉凛花は、自身の両親の死をきっかけに、従兄である西宮朔と一緒に暮らすことになった。幼い頃から、凛花にとっては朔だけが心の拠り所。そして、初恋の相手。しかし、朔には凛花に伝えていない秘密があり——…？特殊能力持ちの少女×謎多き青年のラブサスペンス！"
  },
